OL,3,GNEWSAMore work needed to assess        
OL,4,AJersey's Neet numbers                  
OL,6,FFurther work is needed to establish a  
OL,7,F"reliable island-wide picture" of young
OL,8,Fpeople not in education, employment or 
OL,9,Ftraining, according to Jersey's        
OL,10,Feducation minister.                    
OL,12,FIt follows a UK review by former       
OL,13,Fminister Alan Milburn, who proposed    
OL,14,Fwidespread changes to help get young   
OL,15,Fpeople who are not in education,       
OL,16,Femployment or training (Neet) into     
OL,17,Fwork.                                  
OL,19,FThe report said the UK should aim to   
OL,20,Freduce the rate of Neet young people   
OL,21,Ffrom 13% to about 5% by 2036.          
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
