OL,3,GNEWSAMore work needed to assess        
OL,4,AJersey's Neet numbers                  
OL,6,FDeputy Catherine Curtis said Jersey did
OL,7,Fnot have a universal measure of the    
OL,8,Fnumber of people aged between 16 and   
OL,9,F24, but said officials would look      
OL,10,Fcarefully at the report's              
OL,11,Frecommendations and consider what the  
OL,12,Fisland could learn from it.            
